From 863e15d493230b98a19ccdb5ed98aa623aee04d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Munther AlTawash <meemz28@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:18:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ios/health): backfill full WHOOP/strap history into
 Apple Health

Routine write-back only covers the trailing 14 days, so an imported WHOOP
CSV history never reaches Apple Health. Adds HealthKitBridge.backfillHistory
(days:) which walks the range in 30-day, local-noon-aligned chunks (newest
first) and reuses the existing idempotent vitals/sleep/workout writers.
Adds a 'Backfill history' control (90d / 1y / everything) to the Apple
Health card, and unit tests for the pure chunking helper.
